{"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSToolBarTop\/init(title:hasLargeTitle:subtitle:leadingItems:principalItem:trailingItems:)"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSToolBarTop\/body(content:)"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Methods","title":"Instance Methods"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSToolBarTop\/ViewModifier-Implementations"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations","title":"Default Implementations"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/7SwiftUI12ViewModifierP"],"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudstoolbartop"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSToolBarTop"}]}]},{"content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Warning","type":"text"}]},{"text":": If an item is placed in principal position, the subtitle is never displayed (whatever ","type":"text"},{"code":"hasLargeTitle","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is), because","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"SwiftUI’s ","type":"text"},{"code":".principal","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" placement only replaces the inline compact bar title, not ","type":"text"},{"code":".navigationSubtitle()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (iOS 26+), which would","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"otherwise keep rendering next to the item with no visible title next to it. The title itself is displayed only if ","type":"text"},{"code":"hasLargeTitle","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is ","type":"text"},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (in that case it appears below the bar, in large title mode, not inside it).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Appearances","anchor":"Appearances","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"With Liquid Glass \/ iOS 26+ the OS will change the rendering of the toolbar items depending to the context:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The OS can group the items of same types in one group with kind of rectangle (e.g. views with menus)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"But for buttons items they will remain isolated","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The placement of the title can be leading or centered depending to the length of the text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The text can be truncated if there is not enough remaining space","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The OS can apply another style for the back button"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Without Liquid Glass \/ iOS 18 and lower, the OS won’t change that much the style of the toolbar items, Items won’t be visually grouped."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Globaly the appearence of the * navigation bar* elements is changed by the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"oudsNavigationBarAppearance"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"helper of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View"},{"type":"text","text":" that must be applyed on the root view of the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NavigationStack"},{"type":"text","text":" for example."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Technical constraints","anchor":"Technical-constraints"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To be sure for iOS 18 and lower the back buttton and text have the good color, in your main view apply the following accent color:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["    struct AppMainView: View {","        var body: some View {","            ContentView()","                .accentColor(theme.colors.contentDefault)","        }","    }"],"syntax":"swift"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Platform considerations","anchor":"Platform-considerations"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The component is available on iOS, iPadOS, and visionOS","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The component is not available for watchOS, tvOS and macOS","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"text":"Badges uses","anchor":"Badges-uses","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For iOS 26 with Liquid Glass, the system badge is used because the OUDS badge component does not provide a suitable","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"rendering with the glassified effect applied on the top toolbar.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"For iOS until 18 and without Liquid Glass  OUDS badge component is always used.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Code sample","anchor":"Code-sample","type":"heading","level":2},{"syntax":"swift","code":["    ContentView()","        .toolBarTop(\"Title\",","            leadingItems: {","                OUDSToolBarItem(navigation: .back())","            },","            principalItem: OUDSToolBarItem(icon: Image(decorative: \"search\"), accessibilityLabel: \"Search\") { \/* Action to process *\/ },","            trailingItems: {","                OUDSToolBarItem(label: \"Label\") { \/* Action to process *\/ }","                OUDSToolBarItem(icon: Image(decorative: \"some_image\"), accessibilityLabel: \"Label\") { \/* Action to process *\/ }","            }","        )"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"code":"View","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" helper can also be used to apply a SwiftUI toolbar configuration.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["    toolBarTop(_:hasLargeTitle:subtitle:leadingItems:principalItem:trailingItems:)"],"type":"codeListing"},{"text":"Design documentation","anchor":"Design-documentation","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/r.orange.fr\/r\/S-ouds-doc-ios-tool-bar-top","type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Themes rendering","anchor":"Themes-rendering","type":"heading","level":2},{"text":"Liquid Glass","anchor":"Liquid-Glass","type":"heading","level":3},{"text":"Orange","anchor":"Orange","type":"heading","level":4},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_toolBarTop_LiquidGlass_Orange_light","type":"image"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"component_toolBarTop_LiquidGlass_Orange_dark","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":4,"type":"heading","text":"Orange Compact","anchor":"Orange-Compact"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_toolBarTop_LiquidGlass_OrangeCompact_light","type":"image"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"component_toolBarTop_LiquidGlass_OrangeCompact_dark","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Sosh","type":"heading","level":4,"anchor":"Sosh"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_toolBarTop_LiquidGlass_Sosh_light"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"image","identifier":"component_toolBarTop_LiquidGlass_Sosh_dark"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":4,"type":"heading","text":"Wireframe","anchor":"Wireframe"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_to